      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This review discusses the evidence base for medications that are currently used for obesity and eating disorders, including their Food and Drug Administration approval status by disorder and age group, contraindications, and major adverse effects. Investigational agents currently being considered, issues related to psychiatric and medical comorbidity, limitations of pharmacologic strategies, and recommendations for treatment are also addressed."
      },
